-- Drops laplace_eff_mu(subject, type, object). Readers compute
-- consensus.eff_mu(rating, rd) on the consensus row they hold, which inlines and
-- matches the (rating - 2*rd) expression indexes; a lookup wrapper does neither.
DROP FUNCTION IF EXISTS laplace.laplace_eff_mu(bytea, bytea, bytea);
DROP FUNCTION IF EXISTS laplace.laplace_eff_mu(bytea, bytea, bytea);
